0,"Kalinga, Mabaka Valley Language (KKG) - L1 & L2 Speakers, Status, Map ...",https://www.ethnologue.com/language/kkg/,"Mabaka Valley Kalinga is a stable indigenous language of the Philippines. It belongs to the Austronesian language family. Direct evidence is lacking, but the language is thought to be used as a first language by all in the ethnic community. It is not known to be taught in schools.","Kalinga, Mabaka Valley",Austronesian
